# The whole stack runs on Linux: Docker images, the Postgres init scripts, the
# CI runners. A CRLF line ending in a shell script makes it fail there with an
# error that reads like nothing to do with line endings, so normalise on commit
# and check out LF everywhere regardless of the developer's platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
